# A local report fixtures directory at the repository root is intentionally not
# versioned; the tracked public sample lives under reports/example/. Anchored to
# the root on purpose — an unanchored rule also swallowed
# experiments/time-reference/examples/, which the README points readers at and a
# test reads, so the suite passed locally and failed on every clean checkout.
/examples/

# This project's own time analysis is a generated artifact, not source: the
# analyzer derives it deterministically from report.json plus time.config.json,
# and `task-progress.exe start` regenerates it whenever a time input exists.
# Tracking it committed ~190 kB that re-churns its `as_of` stamp on every run.
# The inputs stay versioned — /time.config.json and /report.modules.json are
# authored, and losing them would lose real configuration. Anchored to the root
# so experiments/time-reference/examples/time.analysis.json, which the test
# suite does read, stays tracked.
/time.analysis.json
